@startuml
title S2 - Mengerjakan Simulasi Tugas & Menerima Feedback

actor "Job Seeker" as U
participant "UI" as UI
participant "Simulation" as SIM
participant "Feedback & Progress" as FP
database "Database" as DB

== Pilih skenario ==
U -> UI: Buka halaman Simulasi
UI -> SIM: getScenarios(jobId)
SIM -> DB: query skenario
DB --> SIM: daftar skenario
SIM --> UI: daftar skenario
UI --> U: Tampilkan skenario

U -> UI: Pilih skenario
UI -> SIM: getTasks(scenarioId)
SIM -> DB: query task
DB --> SIM: daftar task
SIM --> UI: daftar task
UI --> U: Tampilkan task

== Kirim jawaban ==
U -> UI: Isi jawaban lalu klik "Kirim"
UI -> SIM: submitAnswers(userId, scenarioId, answers)

alt Ada jawaban kosong
  SIM --> UI: error validasi
  UI --> U: "Semua task wajib diisi"
else Semua jawaban terisi
  SIM -> SIM: evaluate_simulation(correct, total)
  SIM -> FP: getFeedback(status)
  FP -> DB: ambil teks feedback
  DB --> FP: teks feedback
  FP --> SIM: feedback
  SIM -> FP: saveResult(userId, scenarioId, score)
  FP -> DB: simpan hasil
  DB --> FP: OK
  FP --> SIM: tersimpan
  SIM --> UI: skor + status + feedback
  UI --> U: Tampilkan hasil dan feedback

  opt Status "Perlu Latihan Lagi"
    UI --> U: Sarankan ulang materi & coba lagi
    U -> UI: Klik "Ulangi Simulasi"
    UI -> SIM: getTasks(scenarioId)
    SIM --> UI: daftar task
    UI --> U: Tampilkan task dari awal
  end
end
@enduml
